code: 0
--- stdout
The change is released

  From:      Ready, In progress
  To:        Done; an issue already there keeps it, so a repeat is safe
  Requires:  nothing besides the issue numbers
  Optional:  --comment
  Batch:     gh dojo done 12 13 14: each issue on its own, a failed one skipped;
             exit code 5 when some were written: a re-run finishes the rest
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Close:     closes the issue as completed; an issue already closed stays as it is
  Comment:   posted unless it renders empty or is already the latest gh-dojo comment:
               {comment}

Usage:
  gh dojo done <N>... [flags]

Flags:
      --comment string   text for {comment} in the comment
      --comments N|all   how many of the latest comments the card prints, or all (up to 100); implies --show (default 5)
      --dry-run          print the plan without changing anything
      --full             print the card's description and comments without cutting them; implies --show
  -h, --help             help for done
      --show             also print the issue's card, as gh dojo show N does, from the same read

Global flags: --jq, --json, --template (see gh dojo --help)
--- stderr
